Package: GPSA
Type: Package
Title: Gene-set Perturbation Signature Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shipeng", "Shao", email = "shaozhen1995@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: GPSA provides fast similarity search over large-scale perturbation
    signature databases using cMAP/GSEA-style rankZ semantics. It supports
    single gene-set queries, up/down bidirectional queries, multi-channel
    event definitions, batch queries, and vector-based full geneList searches.
    HDF5-based storage enables memory-efficient querying with optional
    preloading for maximum speed (~0.15s per query in memory mode).
